  "description": "Tired, overworked Hui-Na thinks dungeons and Hunters have nothing to do with her until she's suddenly gifted with a Hunter's abilities. Now she has to navigate her game-like reality with the skills and stats of... a Homemaker?! With this class, Hui-Na becomes the ultimate cook, custodian, and caretaker, which lands her a seemingly harmless job in a Hunter guild. But will this organization help Hui-Na bring the Hunters a revolution of rest or force her into dangers she'd never dreamed of? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
